        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Projects: Red Bird, Buffy the Vampire Slayer, Seinfeld, Ratchet & Clank, BioShock\n- People: Misti Boland, Jeremy Osbern, Alexandra Goodman, Ian Stark, Armin Shimerman, Kitty Swink, Mike McShane, John Prosky\n- Roles: Quark, Principal Snyder, Stan, Dr. Nefarious, Andrew Ryan\n\nFacts:\n- Red Bird was created by Misti Boland and Jeremy Osbern.\n- Red Bird stars Alexandra Goodman, Ian Stark, Armin Shimerman, Kitty Swink, Mike McShane, and John Prosky.\n- Armin Shimerman played Quark, a Ferengi bartender, in a television series.\n- Armin Shimerman played Principal Snyder in Buffy the Vampire Slayer.\n- Armin Shimerman played Kramer's caddy Stan on Seinfeld.\n- Armin Shimerman voiced Dr. Nefarious in the Ratchet & Clank series.\n- Armin Shimerman voiced Andrew Ryan, one of the antagonists of BioShock.",
